NOT A VALIDATED SYSTEM. READ THIS BEFORE USING THE SOFTWARE ANYWHERE THAT
MATTERS.

This is a technical demonstration and reference implementation. It has NOT
been validated as computerised system software under GAMP 5, and it has no
URS, IQ/OQ/PQ protocol, traceability matrix or validation summary report. A
system that creates or stores pharmacovigilance (PV) records must itself be
validated before it is used for that purpose; using unvalidated software to
produce regulated safety records is a deviation in its own right.

